  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Teaching in Transformation: Navigating Digital, AI, and Crisis Challenges</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO Tehran is dedicated to equipping all teachers in Iran including refugees, with the skills needed to navigate the challenges of the digital transformation and artificial intelligence. Our focused initiatives include tailored training in Social and Emotional Learning (SEL) and emphasizing child protection. This strategic approach aims to enhance learning outcomes by empowering teachers to adapt to evolving educational landscapes and create supportive environments for students in the face of these complex challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
